{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>K-Pop 粉絲們的福音來了！如果你厭倦了在演唱會或粉絲活動中攜帶笨重的應援牌，又擔心自己的心意無法被偶像看見，那麼這款《FanBanner》絕對是你的救星。它能將你的智能手機瞬間變成演唱會上最搶眼的應援牌，讓你的訊息在黑暗中也能清晰傳達。現在，這款為 K-Pop 應援而生的智能工具限時免費中，快來把握機會，讓你的愛被偶像看見吧！</p>\n\n<h2>超亮 LED 顯示</h2>\n<p>這款應用具備超高亮度的 LED 文本顯示，即便在最昏暗的演唱會現場，你的訊息也能從遠距離清晰可見。它為 K-Pop 粉絲設計了多樣化的動態主題，包括霓虹光、閃爍、愛心及動畫表情符號等，讓應援牌充滿活力。你還能在演唱會中即時修改文字內容、顏色與特效，並加入捲動、閃爍或霓虹效果，隨時給予偶像最即時且吸睛的鼓勵與反應。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/1242x2688bb-188-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/1242x2688bb-189-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/1242x2688bb-190-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/1242x2688bb-191-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/1242x2688bb-192-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/1242x2688bb-193-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：FanBanner : kpop LED</li>\n<li>應用類別：Entertainment</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-05-28T05:34:18.463184+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":394,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"unknown"}}